      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes a lot of sense. It's interesting how those little components have to \"fit\" together so precisely. You mentioned it's like unwrapping a miniature structure—do you think there's a good way to visualize this \"layering\" or \"stacking\" for students? Like, is there a specific mental model that helps illustrate how these tiny units function together within the larger word?",
